<p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> &quot;<em>So Says I</em>&quot; is the title of a song by the band <em>The Shins</em>, and <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><strong>I do not claim any ownership over the phrase/title</strong></span>. I only named the article as such due to the inspirational factors the song had on the creation of this article. If this is not allowed, <em>please</em> do not hesitate to let me know and I will change the title immediately if need be. Thank you.</p>
